{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o080b","title":"沛王曹林去世","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o080b-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"沛王曹林去世","evidence":["shaodi-e-o080b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0087","role":"卒","evidence":["shaodi-e-o080b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":256,"label":"乙巳","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y256","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o080","basis":"乙巳"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o080b-q","shaodi-q-o080","shaodi-q-o117","shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o080b-q","source_order":[4,387,"O080b"],"order":1162}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0087","name":"曹林（沛王）","evidence":["shaodi-q-o080","xiahoucao-q-p047"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"shaodi-m-o080-shaodi-p0087","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o080"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-p047-shaodi-p0087","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-p047"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o080b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-5e69a7d6a960c6ff6623","layer":"original","quote":"甘露元年春正月辛丑〖1〗，青龙现轵县井中〖2〗。乙巳〖3〗，沛王林薨〖4〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":386,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：甘露二年（公元 257 ）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":535,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4dd98e402a6a8de51491","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"shaodi-q-o080","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-5e69a7d6a960c6ff6623","layer":"original","quote":"甘露元年春正月辛丑〖1〗，青龙现轵县井中〖2〗。乙巳〖3〗，沛王林薨〖4〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":386,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41},{"id":"shaodi-q-o117","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-d021e0b00f489a01f208","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，青龙现温县井中。三月，司空卢毓薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":522,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p047","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-8f654c67b72ea809e6a5","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏末传》曰：“晏妇金乡公主，即晏同母妹。公主贤，谓其母沛王太妃曰：‘晏为恶日甚，将何保身？’母笑曰：‘汝得无妒晏邪？’俄而晏死。有一男，年五六岁，宣王遣人录之。晏（母）〔妇〕归藏其子王宫中，向使者搏颊，乞白活之。使者具以白宣王。宣王亦闻晏妇有先见之言，心常嘉之；且为沛王故，特原不杀。”臣松之按：《魏末传》云晏取其同母妹为妻，此搢绅所不忍言；虽楚王之妻（嫂）〔媦〕，不是甚也已。设令此言出于旧史，犹将莫之或信，况底下之书乎？按《诸王公传》，沛王出自杜夫人所生。晏母姓尹，公主若与沛王同生，焉得言与晏同母？","attribution":"《魏末传》；裴松之按语","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":386,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-46a3d2d6a327171eb9f7","start":0,"end":253}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
